        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.224,
            0.274,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it Out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.255,
            0.368,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": "**Q.1. Find the missing terms:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.282,
            0.716,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": "**a. Perimeter of a rectangle = 14 cm; breadth = 2 cm; length = ?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.309,
            0.626,
            0.327
          ],
          "content": "**b. Perimeter of a square = 20 cm; side of a length = ?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.336,
            0.693,
            0.354
          ],
          "content": "**c. Perimeter of a rectangle = 12 m; length = 3 m; breadth = ?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.364,
            0.325,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "**Ans**. (a) length = 5 cm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.391,
            0.399,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": "(b) length of a side = 5 cm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.418,
            0.33,
            0.435
          ],
          "content": "(c) breadth = 3cm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.445,
            0.883,
            0.498
          ],
          "content": "**Q.2. A rectangle having side lengths 5 cm and 3 cm is made using a piece of wire. If the wire is straightened and then bent to form a square, what will be the length of a side of the square?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.508,
            0.456,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Length of a side of square = 4 cm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.535,
            0.883,
            0.57
          ],
          "content": "**Q.3. Find the length of the third side of a triangle having a perimeter of 55 cm and having two sides of length 20 cm and 14 cm, respectively?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.58,
            0.534,
            0.598
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Length of the third side of triangle = 21 cm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.607,
            0.881,
            0.642
          ],
          "content": "**Q.4. What would be the cost of fencing a rectangular park whose length is 150 m and breadth is 120 m, if the fence costs Rs.40 per metre?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.652,
            0.609,
            0.669
          ],
          "content": "Ans. P = 2 × (150+120) = 540; So, 540 × 40 = Rs. 21,600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.679,
            0.881,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": "**Q.5. A piece of string is 36 cm long. What will be the length of each side, if it is used to form:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.725,
            0.275,
            0.742
          ],
          "content": "**a. A square,**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.751,
            0.572,
            0.769
          ],
          "content": "**b. A triangle with all sides of equal length, and**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.778,
            0.735,
            0.796
          ],
          "content": "**c. A hexagon (a six sided closed figure) with sides of equal length?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.806,
            0.512,
            0.823
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** (a) Length of each side of square = 9 cm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.833,
            0.594,
            0.851
          ],
          "content": "(b) Length of each side of regular triangle = 12 cm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.86,
            0.589,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "(c) Length of each side of regular hexagon = 6 cm"
        },
        {
